    "detailed_description": "<h1>Check Out This</h1><p><br><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2310730/extras/c44cd10ba0019805745ba1c1b09f0fc4.poster.avif?t=1738591661\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2310730/extras/c44cd10ba0019805745ba1c1b09f0fc4.webm?t=1738591661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2310730/extras/c44cd10ba0019805745ba1c1b09f0fc4.mp4?t=1738591661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The story begins with a massive fire that destroyed an ongoing ritual,<br> causing ghosts and ghouls to run rampant in both the celestial and mortal realms.<br><br>To restart the ritual, the protagonist &quot;Hong-Niang&quot; must assist her parents in purchasing the ingredients required for the ceremony in town.<br>And with the assistance of two mythical creatures, &quot;Taotie&quot; and &quot;Fu-Xi,&quot; complete the mission; <br>thwart the mischief-makers disrupting the ceremony, restoring order to both the celestial and mortal realms.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><i></i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2310730/extras/4f8f4e95d62ba93e75fb617f6576ddd4.poster.avif?t=1738591661\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2310730/extras/4f8f4e95d62ba93e75fb617f6576ddd4.webm?t=1738591661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2310730/extras/4f8f4e95d62ba93e75fb617f6576ddd4.mp4?t=1738591661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Chinese-style art and architectural scenes.</li></ul></strong>Whether it's the magnificent Jiu Ge Restaurant or the uniquely themed town, every map is worth exploring and savoring.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2310730/extras/7ad1ca07ae28e5768222c713438c1601.poster.avif?t=1738591661\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2310730/extras/7ad1ca07ae28e5768222c713438c1601.webm?t=1738591661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><strong><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Shadow puppetry stories and real recipes.</li></ul></strong>Legendary stories presented through paper-cut shadow puppetry and actual mooncake recipes used in the game provide you with a deeper sense of immersion and surprises!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2310730/extras/0ffb594a543606d8ad5e26e881bcdd67.poster.avif?t=1738591661\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2310730/extras/0ffb594a543606d8ad5e26e881bcdd67.webm?t=1738591661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2310730/extras/0ffb594a543606d8ad5e26e881bcdd67.mp4?t=1738591661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Two battle modes and four difficulty levels to choose from.</li></ul></strong>Different choices will affect the gameplay; we offer three difficulty levels and a non-combat version for you to choose freely.<br><br><strong><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Parodying mythical stories.</li></ul></strong>A funny and entertaining plot that breaks the established impression of mythical stories! Suitable for players who enjoy lighthearted and cheerful narratives.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Special Thanks</h2>Assistance with publishing the game on Steam: <br>Maker\u88fd\u9020\u6a5f- Chimaki<br><br>Multi-language system plugins:<br>Mirai<br><br>Promotional video BGM:<br>\u9b54\u738b\u9b42",
